    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GITHUB INSIGHTS REPORTER\n\n## Why?\n\nGitHub only keeps your traffic analytics (views and clones) for 14 days; after that, the data is gone forever.  \nManually exporting those insights every week is tedious, and most developers simply forget to do it.  \n\nThis solves that by automatically pulling your GitHub stats, saving them in Google Sheets for long-term tracking, and sending summaries to Slack.  \n\n",
        "height": 576,
        "width": 368
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        624,
        -176
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "48dd07c7-4935-4e72-96f3-30a39c001294",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1: GET DATA\n\n-->Runs automatically to collect your GitHub analytics.  \n",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 864,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1056,
        -160
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "3ad4515c-4e5c-4860-9706-32e2870dbf5c",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 2: LOG DATA  TO SHEETS & GET DATA FOR REPORTING\n\n-->Saves your analytics to Google Sheets for long-term tracking.  \n\n-->Each new report is added as a separate row, preserving your full history over time.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 592,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2208,
        -160
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "6b354c52-e439-4d11-80c4-86294fbda2de",
      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Flatten GitHub traffic data for Sheets + QuickChart\nconst views = $json[\"views\"] || [];\nreturn views.map(v => ({\n  date: v.timestamp.split(\"T\")[0],\n  views: v.count,\n  uniques: v.uniques\n}));\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1792,
        32
      ],
      "id": "90e43618-4b7e-4ed4-937a-66b172b7389b",
      "name": "Format Views Data"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Flatten GitHub clones data into a daily array\n// Input: full GitHub API response for /traffic/clones\n\n// Step 1: Access the clones array safely\nconst clonesArray = $json[0]?.clones || $json.clones || [];\n\n// Step 2: Transform it into a flat list\nreturn clonesArray.map(c => ({\n  date: c.timestamp.split('T')[0],\n  clones: c.count,\n  unique_cloners: c.uniques\n}));\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1792,
        224
      ],
      "id": "d6f18e74-3a0e-4697-b7de-8b0983175b5d",
      "name": "Format Clones Data"
    },
